  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS_6738_Integrated Program for HFC Phasing Down and Sustainable Cooling for Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brief project description: The project objective is to support Tajikistan in meeting its Montreal Protocol KigaliAmendment obligation to rapidly reduce consumption of HFC by 70% in 2029. This widely used coolinginfrastructure refrigerant as well as an insulating foam blowing agent has high global warming potential (GWP)and is a major contributor to global warming when emitted to the atmosphere. Tajikistan has a significantlygreater HFC consumption obligations relative to similar countries given</narrative>
  </description>
